{% comment %}
    SITE NAVIGATION — template for the Page Menu block in the Site.Master
    "Navigation" zone. One block renders all three presentations of the menu:

        .nav-row     logo · top-level links · Discover CTA · hamburger
        .mega        the mega panel (desktop): visit info, one column of child
                     pages per top-level page, today's hours / office / social
        .mobilenav   the full-screen drawer (below 1000px): <details> per
                     top-level page, CTA, visit info, social, hours

    Block settings:
      * Root Page:           41952 (the site's home / parent page)
      * Number of Levels:    2
      * Template:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/PageNav.lava' %}

    Markup contract (styled by Styles/_header.scss, driven by Assets/Scripts/theme.js):
      .nav__link[data-page=ID]  ↔  .mega__col[data-col=ID]   pairs a link with its column
      [data-mobilenav-open] / [data-mobilenav-close]          drawer buttons
      --menu-cols (inline on .site-nav)                       number of top-level pages,
                                                              drives the shared column grid

    STATIC FOR NOW: everything that isn't the page tree (visit info, service
    times, office, playground hours, social links, the Discover link) is
    hardcoded below and repeated in Footer.lava. ROCK: make these dynamic later
    (schedules, campus, global attributes); search both files for the text.

    The design was drawn around four top-level pages; the grid adapts to the
    count, but more than five will crowd the row.
{% endcomment %}
{%- comment -%}
    Today's hours. STATIC FOR NOW: the weekly playground schedule is written
    out here and today's row is picked server-side (Rock's organisation time
    zone). ROCK: this becomes a dynamic schedule (major events, office hours,
    playground hours). Same block in PageNav.lava and Footer.lava.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign todayName = 'Now' | Date:'dddd' -%}
{%- case todayName -%}
    {%- when 'Sunday' or 'Monday' or 'Tuesday' -%}{%- assign playgroundToday = '9:00am – 1:00pm' -%}
    {%- when 'Wednesday' -%}{%- assign playgroundToday = '11:30am – 1:00pm' -%}
    {%- when 'Thursday' -%}{%- assign playgroundToday = '9:00am – 1:00pm &amp; 5:30 – 8:00pm' -%}
    {%- else -%}{%- assign playgroundToday = 'Closed' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- assign topPages = Page.Pages -%}
{%- assign menuCols = topPages | Size -%}
{%- assign logoUrl = '~~/Assets/Images/vrl_logo.png' | ResolveRockUrl -%}
{%- assign homeUrl = '~' | ResolveRockUrl -%}

<div class="site-nav" style="--menu-cols: {{ menuCols }}">

    <div class="container nav-row">
        <a class="nav__logo" href="{{ homeUrl }}" aria-label="Valley Real Life — home">
            {%- comment -%} Two copies cross-fade: ink wordmark on the light bar, as drawn on the dark open-menu bar (see .nav__logo in _header.scss). {%- endcomment -%}
            <img class="nav__logo-ink" src="{{ logoUrl }}" width="694" height="168" alt="" />
            <img class="nav__logo-light" src="{{ logoUrl }}" width="694" height="168" alt="" />
        </a>

        <nav class="nav__list" aria-label="Main">
            {%- for childPage in topPages %}
            <a class="nav__link{% if childPage.Current or childPage.IsParentOfCurrent %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ childPage.Url }}" data-page="{{ childPage.Id }}"{% if childPage.Current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ childPage.Title }}</a>
            {%- endfor %}
        </nav>

        <div class="nav__actions">
            <a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm nav__cta" href="/discover-vrl">Discover VRL</a>
            <button class="nav__burger" type="button" data-mobilenav-open aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobilenav">
                <span class="u-visually-hidden">Open menu</span>
                <svg width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-menu"/></svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ===== MEGA MENU (desktop) ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="mega-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="mega" id="megamenu">
        <div class="container mega__inner">
            <div class="mega__visit">
                <h2>Join us this week</h2>
                <a class="mega__address" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=1831+S+Barker+Rd+Spokane+Valley+WA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                    1831 S. Barker Rd.<br />Spokane Valley, WA 99016
                    <span class="u-visually-hidden">(opens map in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <p class="mega__times">
                    <strong>Service times</strong>
                    Thursdays at 6:30pm<br />
                    Sundays at 8:00, 9:30, 11:00am &amp; 12:30pm
                </p>
            </div>

            {%- for childPage in topPages %}
            <div class="mega__col" data-col="{{ childPage.Id }}">
                <ul aria-label="{{ childPage.Title | Escape }}">
                    {%- for grandchildPage in childPage.Pages %}
                    <li><a href="{{ grandchildPage.Url }}"{% if grandchildPage.Current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ grandchildPage.Title }}</a></li>
                    {%- endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}

            <div class="mega__aside">
                <div class="mega__hours" data-today="true">
                    <div class="mega__hours-head">
                        <span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Today's hours</h3>
                    </div>
                    <dl>
                        <div><dt>Playground · {{ todayName }}</dt><dd>{{ playgroundToday }}</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                    <a href="/kids#playground">All playground hours</a>
                </div>

                <div class="mega__contact">
                    <p class="mega__contact-label">Church office</p>
                    <p>Mon – Thu, 9:00am – 4:00pm</p>
                    <p><a href="tel:+15092320840">(509) 232-0840</a></p>
                    <p><a href="mailto:hello@vrl.church">hello@vrl.church</a></p>
                </div>

                <ul class="social" aria-label="Valley Real Life on social media">
                    <li><a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-instagram"/></svg></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" aria-label="Facebook"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-facebook"/></svg></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" aria-label="YouTube"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-youtube"/></svg></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" aria-label="Podcast"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-microphone"/></svg></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" aria-label="Blog feed"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rss"/></svg></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        {%- comment -%} Touch devices (no hover): a way out of the panel. theme.js handles [data-mega-close]. {%- endcomment %}
        <div class="mega__foot">
            <button class="mega__close" type="button" data-mega-close>
                <svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-x"/></svg>
                Close menu
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ===== MOBILE DRAWER ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="mobilenav" id="mobilenav" data-open="false" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mobilenav__top">
            <a href="{{ homeUrl }}" aria-label="Valley Real Life — home"><img class="logo" src="{{ logoUrl }}" width="694" height="168" alt="" /></a>
            <button class="mobilenav__close" type="button" data-mobilenav-close>
                <span class="u-visually-hidden">Close menu</span>
                <svg width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-x"/></svg>
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="mobilenav__body">
            <div class="mobilenav__cta"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/discover-vrl">Discover VRL</a></div>

            <nav aria-label="Mobile">
                {%- for childPage in topPages %}
                {%- assign grandchildCount = childPage.Pages | Size -%}
                {%- if grandchildCount == 0 %}
                <a class="mobilenav__single" href="{{ childPage.Url }}">{{ childPage.Title }}</a>
                {%- else %}
                <details name="mobilenav">
                    <summary>{{ childPage.Title }} <svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg></summary>
                    <ul class="mobilenav__sub">
                        {%- for grandchildPage in childPage.Pages %}
                        <li><a href="{{ grandchildPage.Url }}">{{ grandchildPage.Title }}</a></li>
                        {%- endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </details>
                {%- endif %}
                {%- endfor %}
            </nav>

            <div class="mobilenav__foot">
                <div>
                    <h3>Join us this week</h3>
                    <a class="mega__address" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=1831+S+Barker+Rd+Spokane+Valley+WA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">1831 S. Barker Rd.<br />Spokane Valley, WA 99016<span class="u-visually-hidden">(opens map in a new tab)</span></a>
                    <ul class="social" aria-label="Valley Real Life on social media">
                        <li><a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-instagram"/></svg></a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" aria-label="Facebook"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-facebook"/></svg></a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" aria-label="YouTube"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-youtube"/></svg></a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" aria-label="Podcast"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-microphone"/></svg></a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" aria-label="Blog feed"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rss"/></svg></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Service times</strong>
                    Thursdays at 6:30pm<br />
                    Sundays at 8:00, 9:30,<br />11:00am &amp; 12:30pm
                </div>
                <div class="mobilenav__extra">
                    <p class="today-line">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg>
                        <a href="/kids#playground">{% if playgroundToday == 'Closed' %}Playground closed today{% else %}Playground today · {{ playgroundToday }}{% endif %}</a>
                    </p>
                    <p><strong>Church office</strong> Mon – Thu, 9:00am – 4:00pm</p>
                    <p><a href="tel:+15092320840">(509) 232-0840</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="mailto:hello@vrl.church">hello@vrl.church</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
